            {
              "content": "=You are writing a weekly business digest for an HVAC company owner.\nUse ONLY the numbers below. Do not invent anything.\n\nPeriod: {{ $json.period }}\nMissed calls: {{ $json.missed_calls }}\nNew leads: {{ $json.new_leads }} (qualified: {{ $json.qualified_leads }}, unqualified: {{ $json.unqualified_leads }})\nInvalid submissions: {{ $json.invalid_submissions }}\nRenewals: {{ $json.renewals }}\nReviews: {{ $json.reviews }} (positive: {{ $json.positive_reviews }}, negative: {{ $json.negative_reviews }})\n\nWrite a short, friendly email body (under 150 words):\n1. One-line summary of the week\n2. The key numbers as bullet points\n3. One suggested action for next week\n\nPlain text only. No subject line."
            }
